{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
After you Cast a {c_important}Core{/c} Skill, lightning tiles outward for {c_number}[{SF_11}|1|]{/c} seconds dealing {c_random}{payload:DAMAGE_TOOLTIP}{/c} Lightning damage per strike.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if} 

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
